[2026-03-14T21:34:50.368Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01938RSy99n6zru9n4EL3MSV","type":"tool_result","content":"586-- **Expected**: The notification is first marked as read (visual change), then archived and removed from the list. Both actions succeed in sequence without conflict.\n587-\n588:#### Test: Notification row click and archive button have separate hit targets\n589-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, has a notification in the inbox\n590-- **Action**: User clicks specifically on the archive button area of a notification row\n591-- **Expected**: Only the archive action fires — the notification is archived. The user does NOT navigate to the issue detail page. The click targets for \"mark as read + navigate\" and \"archive\" are clearly separated.\n592-\n593-## Team Issues Page (`/team:teamId/issues`)\n594-\n595-**Components**: TeamIssuesList, BulkActions, GroupBySort, TeamFilters\n596-\n597-### TeamIssuesList\n598-"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gj3vaFtLfrx7JxPEitpGLd","session_id":"695214b8-8286-40f6-b215-5d7a6797b8f3","uuid":"1321385f-f4c2-483a-8855-fd284c61a089"}
