e timestamp formatting\n- Sequential operations (mark as read + archive)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aea22728b0ff92700 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 25862\ntool_uses: 11\nduration_ms: 17259</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"695214b8-8286-40f6-b215-5d7a6797b8f3","uuid":"55ed6efe-b67a-42de-99ae-3a0affef760e","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to find information about a LinearClone app. Please:\n\n1. Find the test spec file (docs/tests.md or similar) in the LinearClone app directory - search under /repo/apps/ for it\n2. Find the entry about \"Notification row click and archive button have separate hit targets\" in the test spec\n3. Find notification-related components in the app (look for files with \"notification\" in the name)\n4. Find any existing test files for notifications\n\nReturn the full path to the test spec, the relevant test entry text, paths to notification components, and paths to existing test files.","agentId":"aea22728b0ff92700","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! I have found all the information you requested. Here's a comprehensive summary:\n\n## Test Specification File\n**Full path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n\n## Relevant Test Entry\n**Location in tests.md**: Lines 588-591\n\n**Entry text**:\n```\n#### Test: Notification row click and archive button have separate hit targets\n- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, has a notification in the inbox\n- **Action**: User clicks specifically on the archive button area of a notification row\n- **Expected**: Only the archive action fires — the notification is archived. The user does NOT navigate to the issue detail page. The click targets for \"mark as read + navigate\" and \"archive\" are clearly separated.\n```\n\n## Notification-Related Components\nThe following component files exist in the application:\n\n1. **NotificationRow Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/No